            "description": "<main class=\"c1tt5pk2\" id=\"article-container\" style=\"--c1tt5pk2-0:20px\"><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p>羅斯百貨(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:ROST:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/ROST\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">ROST-US</a>)截至台北時間21日21:30股價上漲11.54美元，報240.34美元，漲幅5.04%，成交量367,204（股），盤中最高價243.86美元、最低價240.53美元。</p></section><p></p><section style=\"margin-top:30px\"><p><em>美股指數盤中表現</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/DJI\">道瓊指數</a>：+0.49%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/INX\">S&amp;P 500</a>指數：+0.34%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/IXIC\">NASDAQ</a>指數：-1%</li><li><a href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/index/GI/SOX\">費城半導體</a>指數：+0.53%</li></ul></section><section><p><em>羅斯百貨(<a data-ga-click-item=\"USS:ROST:STOCK:COMMON\" data-ga-event-name=\"Click_Quote\" data-ga-section=\"News_Article_文中行情\" data-ga-target=\"news\" href=\"https://invest.cnyes.com/usstock/detail/ROST\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_self\">ROST-US</a>)歷史漲跌幅</em></p></section><section style=\"margin-top:20px\"><ul> <li>近 1 週：-6.52%</li> <li>近 1 月：-2.88%</li> <li>近 3 月：+5.14%</li> <li>近 6 月：+13.67%</li> <li>今年以來：+27.12%</li></ul></section></main>",
